01:00:15.780 --> 01:00:18.400
And so these things that
maybe in the next episode,

01:00:18.400 --> 01:00:21.610
we're going to say, ah, these
are kind of far down the line,

01:00:21.610 --> 01:00:23.750
who knows, they could
be here next Tuesday.

01:00:23.750 --> 01:00:25.230
- Right, it's blowing my mind

01:00:25.230 --> 01:00:26.350
how quickly things are changing.

01:00:26.350 --> 01:00:29.840
I didn't realize the discovery
of reprogramming in the eye,

01:00:29.840 --> 01:00:33.280
which was in the book, and
we published very recently,

01:00:33.280 --> 01:00:34.860
has taken the world by storm.

01:00:34.860 --> 01:00:36.560
There's billions of dollars
