01:00:41.380 --> 01:00:43.860
Plus the wearables, these
things are changing,

01:00:43.860 --> 01:00:46.210
and coming to the public all the time.

01:00:46.210 --> 01:00:48.470
The other thing that's happened
thanks to the pandemic is

01:00:48.470 --> 01:00:52.380
