home testing has taken off.

01:00:52.380 --> 01:00:54.130
So there are things we can now do at home

01:00:54.130 --> 01:00:56.400
that were beyond even the imagination

01:00:56.400 --> 01:00:57.720
when we wrote the book.

01:00:57.720 --> 01:00:59.590
- Yes, fundamentally changing

01:00:59.590 --> 01:01:01.430
what healthcare is going to look like

01:01:01.430 --> 01:01:03.340
in this next part of the 21st century.

01:01:03.340 --> 01:01:04.173
- Well, it's exciting.

01:01:04.173 --> 01:01:05.006
A lot of our health

01:01:05.006 --> 01:01:07.050
and our wellness is in our own hands now.

01:01:07.050 --> 01:01:08.050
we have the tools,

01:01:08.050 --> 01:01:11.710
we'll have the knowledge to
greatly lengthen our lifespan,

01:01:11.710 --> 01:01:14.470
